{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">香港小姐2026決賽懶人包（持續更新）！全城矚目選美盛事《2026香港小姐競選決賽》於 8 月 30 日晚 8 點TVB翡翠台現場直播。 12位佳麗分別是：1號袁絲珩Bernice、2號李澤欣Scarlett、3號李澄晴Chorie、4號譚雅文Tiffany、5號魏欣Etherine、6號盧蔚晴Jasmine、7號楊媛媛Vera、8號鄧匡閔Ada、9號周芳姿Gracia、10號陳梓穎Cecilia、11號顏懿菲Agnes及12號湯家琳Caris。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"417cbc97-368f-416a-ae7c-206793b64cbe.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026sPmvABJIzf1788092779.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"417cbc97-368f-416a-ae7c-206793b64cbe.jpg.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"65602a29-049d-4218-8c0f-ea03f7f1de5c.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026Qhrzmfvy2o1788092779.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"65602a29-049d-4218-8c0f-ea03f7f1de5c.jpg.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8p